// Properties for adversarial partitioning model
// Model: ringcast_n6_adversarial.prism
//
// Run via adversarial_sweep.sh to get results for all adversary budgets k.
// For each k, the script runs PRISM for all C(5,k) adversary choices and
// reports the maximum P(partition) — the adversary's best strategy.

// Primary: probability that the adversary's chosen kill set S disconnects
// some live node from the source (node 0).
P=? [ F "partition" ]

// Complementary: probability that the overlay stays fully connected.
P=? [ F "connected" ]
